f86ae990e8 2013-01-23 14:15 exp/locale/collate: preparation for adding Search API. Also changed the collate API further to how (I believe) it will end up being. It is nicer to separate search from sorting functionality. Collation needs tables that are not needed by search and vice-versa.  The common functionality is separated out in the Weigher interface.  As this interface is very low-level, it will be moved to a sub package (colltab) in a next CL. The types that will move to this package are Weigher, Elem, and Level.  The addition of Elem allows for removing some of the duplicate code between collate and collate/build. This CL also introduces some stubs for a higher-level API for options. The default proposed options are quite complex and require the user to have a decent understanding of Unicode collation.  The new options hide a lot of the complexity.
